\ proofs_test.fam — real dev-recursive blocks connected with their chain
\ proofs checked (docs/NODE.md, step 6), a program for the OS after arith,
\ poseidon2, difficulty, pow, chainver, state, proofs and connect, with a
\ disk.  /lib/akjv.txt.gz is the seed file, /lib/chainver the recursive dev
\ network's verifier (chainver_dev.bin), /lib/devchain its first blocks
\ (devchain.bin, from fam_vectors.rs's dump_dev_chain: the chain's
\ constants, genesis, then the blocks).  Each block connects; block 4 with
\ a byte of its proof changed is refused first, changing nothing: for its
\ body commitment, and with a header committing to it, for its proof.

: tpas variable ;  : tfai variable ;  : ctn variable ;  : tbuf variable ;  : thdr variable ;
: ep variable ;  : ecode variable ;  : eh variable ;  : en variable ;  : eb variable ;

\ rdfile ( path -- addr n )  a whole file of at most 1.25 MiB, in memory.
: rdfile
0 lit open  dup 0< if "proofs_test: no file" puts 0A lit putc then
140000 lit alloc
0 lit begin
	2 lit pick  2 lit pick 2 lit pick +  140000 lit 3 lit pick -  read
	dup 0 lit > while +
repeat drop
rot close drop ;

: vok  if tpas @ 1 lit + tpas ! else tfai @ 1 lit + tfai ! then ;
: entry  ep @ @ ecode !  ep @ 4 lit + eh !  ep @ D0 lit + @ en !  ep @ D4 lit + eb !  eb @ en @ + 3 lit + FFFFFFFC lit and ep ! ;

"/lib/akjv.txt.gz" rdfile powinit  400 lit pwitems !
"/lib/chainver" rdfile drop cvinit
"/t-proofs" TREE CREATE or 2 lit or open stinit
"/lib/devchain" rdfile drop  dup @ ctn !  4 lit + dup 60 lit + prinit
"/lib/devchain" rdfile drop 4 lit + 60 lit + CC lit + ep !
-1 lit sprchk !  0 lit tpas !  0 lit tfai !  10000 lit alloc tbuf !  CC lit alloc thdr !
ctn @ 0 lit do
	entry
	i 3 lit = if
		eb @ tbuf @ en @ bcopy  tbuf @ en @ + 64 lit - dup c@ 1 lit xor swap c!
		\ as it is: its header commits to another body
		eh @ tbuf @ en @ sconnect dup FFFFFFF5 lit = vok
		dup FFFFFFF5 lit <> if "tampered block 4 got " puts dup . 0A lit putc then drop
		\ its header given the tampered body's commitment: the proof is refused
		eh @ thdr @ CC lit bcopy  0 lit bcode !  tbuf @ en @ bparse  thdr @ 2C lit + bcommit  thdr @ 2C lit + dfrom
		thdr @ tbuf @ en @ sconnect dup FFFFFFEF lit = vok
		dup FFFFFFEF lit <> if "its proof got " puts dup . 0A lit putc then drop
	then
	eh @ eb @ en @ sconnect dup 0= vok
	dup if "block " puts i 1 lit + u. " got " puts dup . 0A lit putc then drop
loop
"proofs: " puts tpas @ u. " as expected, " puts tfai @ u. " not" puts 0A lit putc
bye
